sequenceDiagram
    participant LC as Legal contract terms
    participant AT as ACTUS term set
    participant SG as Signing service<br/>vLEI + ML-DSA-65
    participant GEN as ACTUS contract generator
    participant CH as On-chain contract
    participant V as Third-party verifier<br/>Regulator, auditor

    LC->>AT: Structured into ACTUS parameters
    AT->>SG: Submit term set
    SG->>SG: Compute TermsHash SHA-256
    SG->>SG: vLEI identity signature + ML-DSA signature
    Note over SG: Full signature stored off-chain<br/>Only the hash is stored on-chain
    SG->>GEN: Signed term set + VersionID
    GEN->>GEN: Deterministic generation
    Note over GEN: Same terms + same target chain<br/>+ same generator version<br/>= byte-identical output
    GEN->>CH: Deploy with TermsHash and VersionID embedded
    V->>CH: Read TermsHash
    V->>GEN: Regenerate from the same terms
    V->>V: Compare bytecode
    Note over V: On-chain logic independently verified<br/>as originating from that signed version
